nt-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035388_308101967934491_2413884904465272539_n.png?_nc_cat=109&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lb4O9Y_uHxwQ7kNvwGcnDUz&_nc_oc=Adpc9EpBDf7YXihmJLZ6b84FScYIf0qeop1_-GLpMkCrnHRdF4sd0OtaWhE-Vkltclw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRY0Jk-ZptQOTP-Y6den5dUBeWyLaYlgKjv7C5312wiWw&oe=6B086AD6"}, "display_name": "Alien Extraction", "keywords": ["puzzle", "security", "scifi", "aliens", "comedy"], "long_description": "# Theres a big alien mess and somebodies gotta clean it up\u2026\n\nControl an alien infested space station in this lighthearted strategy puzzle game. Guide Lenny the janitor through deadly and dangerous levels: sneak, burn, distract, pilot, blast and clean his way to safety. Control drones, check cameras and complete puzzles to solve the station's mysteries.\n\n- Scour video feeds for alien movement or lost clues\n- Pilot drones to explore, distract aliens and lead Lenny to safety\n- Control the facility from the comfort of your security desk\n- Traverse the facility minimap; just don\u2019t trust it\n- Attempt to mute the station AI when it starts insulting you...", "short_description": "Control an alien infested space station in this lighthearted VR strategy puzzle game. Guide Lenny the janitor through deadly and dangerous levels: sneak, burn, distract, pilot, blast and clean his way to safety. Control drones, check cameras and complete puzzles to solve the station's mysteries."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://alienextraction.com/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Crooks Peak", "support_website_url": "https://alienextraction.com/bug.html", "website_url": "https://alienextraction.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}